The Swift and C sources under AgenticoSSH/ and CAgenticoSSHSupport/, and the
native artifacts under Artifacts/, are copied from the AgenticoSSH package of
the Agentico iOS app, a modified version of Heeler
(https://github.com/ZingerLittleBee/Heeler) licensed under the Apache License
2.0 (LICENSE in this directory).

Modifications: renamed one dispatch queue label; added the C module map in
CAgenticoSSHSupport/include so the sources build inside one CocoaPods target.
Module/ is new code (the Expo bridge), also under the Apache License 2.0.

Third-party components keep their own licenses: libssh2 (BSD-3-Clause, with
MIT and BSD-2-Clause parts) and OpenSSL (Apache-2.0), see Artifacts/Notices/.
Artifacts/PROVENANCE.md and Artifacts/Sources.lock record the exact upstream
sources; Artifacts/SHA256SUMS the file checksums (`shasum -a 256 -c
Artifacts/SHA256SUMS` from this directory).
